/// Which delegation capability a built tool exposes (#881 slice 2).
///
/// `General` is the ordinary `sub_agent`: its child inherits the caller's own
/// disallow list, and additionally loses the write-class file tools only when
/// the process-global `--read-only-subagents` switch is on. `Explore` is
